WEBVTT
NOTE SYNC_TYPE: HUMAN_VERIFIED
NOTE Track: 1-04 - Silent Ocean (Mare Tranquillitatis)
NOTE Artist: The Stardust Engine
NOTE Album: Sanctuary (Zero-G) (2003)

00:00:04.422 --> 00:00:11.000
Welcome to Mare Tranquillitatis, the Sea of Tranquility.

00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:18.569
A lunar basin spanning over eight hundred kilometers across the surface.

00:00:19.749 --> 00:00:28.500
Here, there is no atmosphere. There is no weather. There is no wind to disturb the dust.

00:00:28.500 --> 00:00:40.054
It is a place of absolute, unbroken silence. A permanent monument to the freezing scale of the vacuum.

00:00:40.054 --> 00:01:10.115
[Instrumental Intro — Slow Electronic Heartbeat Pulse & Deep Sub-Bass]

00:01:10.115 --> 00:01:15.000
I crossed the border to the Sea of Tranquility

00:01:16.317 --> 00:01:21.500
No wind, no waves, just an endless facility

00:01:23.899 --> 00:01:29.500
The dust is untouched by a single human hand

00:01:30.381 --> 00:01:36.800
A billion years of silence in the silver sand

00:01:37.495 --> 00:01:44.500
I look for a horizon, but the line is completely gone

00:01:44.500 --> 00:01:52.000
Just an infinite black where the sun hasn't shone

00:01:53.000 --> 00:01:58.500
The communications array is completely dark

00:01:58.500 --> 00:02:04.150
Not a single transmission, not a single spark

00:02:06.562 --> 00:02:12.267
I am floating at the bottom of the deepest sea

00:02:12.307 --> 00:02:16.000
Welcome to the silent ocean

00:02:16.000 --> 00:02:20.000
Drifting here without any motion

00:02:20.000 --> 00:02:24.500
A million stars, but not a single sound

00:02:24.500 --> 00:02:28.339
No up, no down, no solid ground

00:02:28.399 --> 00:02:32.500
It's beautiful and it's freezing cold

00:02:32.500 --> 00:02:36.500
A story of the void that was never told

00:02:38.223 --> 00:02:40.500
The silent ocean

00:02:43.008 --> 00:02:46.911
